# M4.29.2 stability command abort

Date: 2026-08-28

## Symptom

The maintenance-window command successfully verified the Tailscale host and
the never-started Adult Candidate, then stopped the three authorized services:

- `tu1nz_agentmode.service`
- `tu1nz_integrity.service`
- `tu1nz_monitor.service`

The following read-only stability section did not start because literal `+`
patch markers were accidentally included in the remote shell text. Bash exited
with a syntax error before the first snapshot or sleep iteration.

## Impact

- affected services: safely stopped/inactive;
- installed scripts or units changed: no;
- Control Git/files changed by this command: no;
- Adult Candidate changed or started: no;
- recovery archive changed: no.

## Resolution

Keep the affected services stopped. Re-run only the read-only Control snapshot
and 11 x 30-second stability observation with the patch markers removed. Do not
install any artifact until that full stability interval succeeds.
